        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Roboamu wakaya ku-Sekemu, nkaambo ku-Sekemu ba-Israyeli boonse nkubakabungene kuzoomupa bwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.1",
