        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Jeroboamu abantu boonse bakaboola kuli-Roboamu mubuzuba bwatatu, mbubonya mbuli ijwi lyamwami lyakuti, Amuboole kulindime mubuzuba bwatatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
