            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ba-Israyeli boonse nibakabona kuti mwami taswiilili, bantu bakavwiila mwami kuti, Iswe tujisi caabilonzi muli-Davida? Tatukwe lukono mumwana wa-Jese pe, Kamuya nyoonse kumaanda aanu nubaIsrayeli, Kobamba iŋanda yako omwini, O Davida, Mpawo ba-Israyeli boonse bakamwaika kuya kumaanda aabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele bana ba-Israyeli ibakakede muminzi ya-Juda, Roboamu kali mwami wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo mwami Roboamu wakatuma Adoramu mupati wacibbalo, nkabela bantu ba-Israyeli bakamutulaula mabwe mane wafwa, Mpawo mwami Roboamu wakafwambaana kutanta munkalaki yakwe akucijila ku-Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
